  "releaseNotes": "Speed up the JSON serialization of spectra and their parameters with the same output\nMzIOJson.jsonSettings is one shared object, so changing it changes every MzIO serialization in the process\nAdd BinaryDataEncoder.Encode for peaks given as m/z, intensity and ion mobility arrays, with the bytes of Encode for the Peak1DArray of these peaks\nAdd BinaryDataDecoder.DecodeArrays, which gives the m/z, intensity and ion mobility arrays of a Peak1DArray description with the values of Decode, and decodes ZLib without peak objects",
